### ==========================================
### 🏢 ORGANIZATION ENDPOINTS (Cookie Auth)
### ==========================================

### 1. Create Organization (Protected: Admin or Organizer)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "name": "Tech Fest1 Kenya",
  "slug": "tech-fest-2028",
  "supportEmail": "support@techfest.co.ke",
  "supportPhone": "+2547123456728",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "payoutPhone": "+254712145679",
  "payoutType": "mpesa_phone",
  "commissionPercentage": "5.00"
}

### 2. List Active Organizations (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/active

### 3. Admin: Get All Organizations (Protected: Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/all
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}

### 4. Search Organizations by Query (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=Te
### 5. Get Organization by URL Slug (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/slug/{{slug}}

### 6. Get Organization Summary Dashboard Stats (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/stats
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 7. Get Total Active Members Count in an Organization (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/members/count
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 8. Get All Members for an Organization (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/members
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 9. Check Member Mapping by User Digital ID and Org ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/members/user/{{digitalId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 10. Get Organization with Full Relations (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/relations
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 11. Get Organization by ID (Public Profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}

### 12. Update Organization Profile Details (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "name": "Tech Fest Africa Updated",
  "supportEmail": "contact@techfest.co.ke"
}

### 13. Update Payout Configuration (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/payout
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "payoutPhone": "+254798765432",
  "payoutType": "paybill"
}

### 14. Admin: Update Organization Commission Percentage (Protected: Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/commission
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}

{
  "commissionPercentage": "7.50"
}

### 15. Admin: Verify or Unverify Organization Badge (Protected: Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}

{
  "isVerified": true
}

### 16. Admin: Toggle Organization Active/Suspended Status (Protected: Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}

{
  "isActive": true
}

### 17. Delete Organization (Protected: Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{orgId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}


### ==========================================
### 👤 ORGANIZATION MEMBER & ROLE ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### 18. Get All Organizations a Specific User Belongs To (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{digitalId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 19. Add a Member to an Organization (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "digitalId": 1,
  "orgRole": "scanner"
}

### 20. Update Organization Member Role (Protected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "orgRole": "admin"
}

### 21. Remove Member from Organization (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}